	JMP GS2		/NO
	TAD I XRT	/OK.WHAT ABOUT SUBS.?
	CIA
	TAD SUBS
	SZA CLA
	JMP GS3		/ALMOST!
	ISZ PT1		/FOUND IT!!
	ISZ PT1		/POINT TO DATA
	POPJ

MAKVAR,	MQA		/GET OUT LAST ZERO ADRESS
	SNA		/ANY ZERO'S?
