	TAD I FLTXR
	DCA I FLTXR2
	ISZ CNTR
	JMP .-3
	JMP FPNT+1
CEXP,	EXP-1
CEX1,	EX1-1

FLSU,	JMS I OPMINS	/FSUB = 2, NEGATE THE OPERAND
